---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { isPrototype, settings } from '../lib/site';
const retentionDays = 90;
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How this website handles enquiries, videos and visitor information.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      {
        isPrototype && (
          <p>
            <span class="placeholder-tag">Draft wording</span> This text describes how the site is currently built. It needs owner and
            legal review before launch, and must be updated if the email or analytics providers change.
          </p>
        )
      }

      <h2>Enquiries you send</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the enquiry form, we receive your name, email address, optional phone number and message. We use them only to reply
        to your enquiry. They are stored securely on the website's server and kept for {retentionDays} days, then deleted. A copy is
        sent by email to {settings.personName} so he can reply. These details never appear in web addresses or in website statistics.
      </p>
      <p>If you email Bharat directly instead, your email is handled by his email provider like any other email.</p>

      <h2>Videos</h2>
      <p>
        Videos hosted on YouTube are not loaded until you press Play. When you do, the video is played by YouTube (Google) using its
        privacy-enhanced mode, and YouTube receives information such as your IP address and device details under its own privacy
        policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Instagram and Facebook links</h2>
      <p>
        Links to Instagram and Facebook take you to those websites, which have their own privacy policies. This website does not load
        Instagram or Facebook content on its pages.
      </p>

      <h2>Website statistics</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use advertising trackers. If visitor statistics are added, they will count actions such as pressing a
        contact link or playing a video, and will not include your name, email address or message.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        To ask about your information or request that an enquiry be deleted, email <a href={`mailto:${settings.email}`}>{settings.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--h3);
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
</style>
